#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/cross_reference_slave.rst:5
msgid "Cross reference at slave element"
msgstr "奴隶要素的交叉参照"

#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/cross_reference_slave.rst:7
msgid ""
"A slave element can only have one master element linked. QElectroTech does "
"not allow that one slave element has more than one cross reference defined."
msgstr "一个奴隶元素只能有一个主元件链接。QElectroTech不允许一个奴隶元素有一个以上的交叉引用定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/cross_reference_slave.rst:13
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech slave element cross reference"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 奴隶元素交叉参考"

#: ../../source/users/element/cross_reference/cross_reference_slave.rst:15
msgid ""
"An slave element has only the properties which defines how the element "
"should be represented, the information from the element is not necessary, "
"the master element is the element which defines the device and the element "
"which appear at the bill of materials (BOM), The information about the "
"device can only be found at the master element."
msgstr ""
"奴隶元素仅具有定义元素应如何表示的属性，元素中的信息是不必要的，主元件是定义设备的元素以及出现在材料单(BOM)中的元素，关于设备的信息只能在主元件中找到。"
